169,drtheivarani,2026-06-17T11:35:07.000Z,"THIS IS YOUR LIST OF ADDITIONAL VACCINE (JIKA BERMINAT) THIS IS YOUR LIST OF ADDITIONAL VACCINE (JIKA BERMINAT) Birth to 6months - rotavirus ( 1st dose before 4months) - RSV Monoclonal antibody Birth to 6months - rotavirus ( 1st dose before 4months) - RSV Monoclonal antibody 6m to 12months -influenza ( 2doses) 6m to 12months -influenza ( 2doses) More than 12months -Chicken pox /varicella -meningococcal -Hepatitis A -Japanese encephalitis - annual influenza vaccine More than 12months -Chicken pox /varicella -meningococcal -Hepatitis A -Japanese encephalitis - annual influenza vaccine Above 4yrs -dengue vaccine Above 4yrs -dengue vaccine Hope this helps ❤️ Hope this helps ❤️",https://www.threads.com/@drtheivarani/post/DZr331biYRC,"",0,0,0,0,NaN
