334,mgd.pediaonline,2026-04-08T23:43:45.000Z,"Dear Barangay Health Centers, please do not withhold giving oral polio vaccine if the baby has already been given oral Rotavirus vaccine. Pwede pong magkasabay o magkasunod. Hindi kailangan tapusin muna ang Rotavirus vaccine series bago maibigay ang oral polio vaccine, and vice versa. Dear Barangay Health Centers, please do not withhold giving oral polio vaccine if the baby has already been given oral Rotavirus vaccine. Pwede pong magkasabay o magkasunod. Hindi kailangan tapusin muna ang Rotavirus vaccine series bago maibigay ang oral polio vaccine, and vice versa. Please refer to the Childhood Immunization Schedule 2026 from PIDSP for guidance. Parents if unsure, please ask your pedia or any licensed pedia🙂 Please refer to the Childhood Immunization Schedule 2026 from PIDSP for guidance. Parents if unsure, please ask your pedia or any licensed pedia🙂",https://www.threads.com/@mgd.pediaonline/post/DW47nRCE4Cs,"",0,0,0,0,NaN
