378,catsbikescakes,2024-12-08T11:11:54.000Z,"What’s behind todays little door? What’s behind todays little door? I clearly recall EVERY 12 year old girl in my school lining up and getting their rubella jab because back then their parents knew how important it is. Seriously, how can someone claim to be “pro life” and anti rubella vaccine? Does not compute. This is a rhetorical question: any antivax answer will be BS and will get an instant account block, a report for medical misinformation and a hidden post. I clearly recall EVERY 12 year old girl in my school lining up and getting their rubella jab because back then their parents knew how important it is. Seriously, how can someone claim to be “pro life” and anti rubella vaccine? Does not compute. This is a rhetorical question: any antivax answer will be BS and will get an instant account block, a report for medical misinformation and a hidden post. What's behind today's little door?MumpsOften overlooked as the middle letter in MMR and perhaps regarded as a bit comical. It put my dad in hospital and caused him to miss my sisters wedding. Not so funny. Lucky for him he didn't catch it earlier as I might not be writing this: it famously causes male sterility, perhaps making it the ultimate in Darwinist FAFO vaccines for any male antivaxxer (or their antivax parents who didnt realise they dont want grandkids) to miss. Try not to laugh. What's behind today's little door?MumpsOften overlooked as the middle letter in MMR and perhaps regarded as a bit comical. It put my dad in hospital and caused him to miss my sisters wedding. Not so funny. Lucky for him he didn't catch it earlier as I might not be writing this: it famously causes male sterility, perhaps making it the ultimate in Darwinist FAFO vaccines for any male antivaxxer (or their antivax parents who didnt realise they dont want grandkids) to miss. Try not to laugh. What's behind today's little door? What's behind today's little door? Often overlooked as the middle 