425,the_2g_network,2026-05-22T12:31:24.000Z,"Prefacing this thread to state up-front that I am a Vaccine Girlie™️. Prefacing this thread to state up-front that I am a Vaccine Girlie™️. If you’re not pro-vaccinations, you are welcome to read along, but your commentary will not be welcomed here. If you’re not pro-vaccinations, you are welcome to read along, but your commentary will not be welcomed here. When I was a kid, I got the MMR vaccine. When I was a kid, I got the MMR vaccine. When I was in my twenties, I got the Hepatitis B vaccine. When I was in my twenties, I got the Hepatitis B vaccine. Because I never got chickenpox, despite being around contagious people right before the actual pox emerged, my OB insisted I get the chickenpox vaccine before having kids. Because I never got chickenpox, despite being around contagious people right before the actual pox emerged, my OB insisted I get the chickenpox vaccine before having kids. I did so. + I did so. +",https://www.threads.com/@the_2g_network/post/DYpBpVZEYB3,"",0,0,0,0,NaN
