428,otravez708,2024-12-16T03:33:56.000Z,"I remember my pediatrician telling my older sister that the rubella vaccine was available and she wanted me to get it. Fast forward 20 years, I'm working as a nurse in a juvenile hall, get a call from ER MD. Kid had been seen there, diagnosed with rubella, doc was concerned for ME, cos I was pregnant. Yup a fetus can be terribly effected by rubella, but I was protected. These crazy parents will be hurting people besides their kids...🥺 I remember my pediatrician telling my older sister that the rubella vaccine was available and she wanted me to get it. Fast forward 20 years, I'm working as a nurse in a juvenile hall, get a call from ER MD. Kid had been seen there, diagnosed with rubella, doc was concerned for ME, cos I was pregnant. Yup a fetus can be terribly effected by rubella, but I was protected. These crazy parents will be hurting people besides their kids...🥺",https://www.threads.com/@otravez708/post/DDn9MEvJ5bp,"",0,0,0,0,NaN
429,kay_wise_threads,2025-09-04T00:39:54.000Z,"Like most kids in the 40s, I easily survived the red measles, i.e. rubella.  So why vaccinate?  Well, I had measles when mom was pregnant. Six months later, my little brother, Ronnie was born with a clef palate, much of his bowel necrotic, his eyes unable to open, his tongue tied, and more.  Mom carried him on a pillow for months he was so weak.  He underwent six operations before age two.  We moved his hands and knees for weeks to teach him to crawl.  1/ Like most kids in the 40s, I easily survived the red measles, i.e. rubella.  So why vaccinate?  Well, I had measles when mom was pregnant. Six months later, my little brother, Ronnie was born with a clef palate, much of his bowel necrotic, his eyes unable to open, his tongue tied, and more.  Mom carried him on a pillow for months he was so weak.  He underwent six operations before age two.  We moved his hands and knees for weeks to teach him to crawl.  1/",https://www.threads.com/@kay_wise_threads/post/DOKRiodkYEO,"",1000,1200,16400,297,NaN
430,barb742,2025-09-04T03:00:54.000Z,"My mom was 8 months pregnant with me when she got Rubella- I was a little early - born with rubella - but I was fine otherwise- 50 years later I ended up in the hospital in DKA- diagnosed with Type I diabetes- almost died. Turns out my T1D was caused by  Congenital rubella syndrome - Rubella can cause type 1 diabetes, as the virus infects and damages the pancreatic beta cells responsible for insulin production- this was before the MMR vaccine-  Vaccines are necessary My mom was 8 months pregnant with me when she got Rubella- I was a little early - born with rubella - but I was fine otherwise- 50 years later I ended up in the hospital in DKA- diagnosed with Type I diabetes- almost died. Turns out my T1D was caused by  Congenital rubella syndrome - Rubella can cause type 1 diabetes, as the virus infects and damages the pancreatic beta cells responsible for insulin production- this was before the MMR vaccine-  Vaccines are necessary",https://www.threads.com/@barb742/post/DOKhrXUDWyD,"",0,0,2900,0,NaN
