1299,dr.nisa.khalil,2025-10-12T05:15:42.000Z,"Replying to @dr.nisa.khalil Replying to @dr.nisa.khalil @dr.nisa.khalil 4/10 “So bila boleh ambil vaksin lepas sembuh, Doc?” 👉 Generally, 4 weeks after recovery is safe. By then, the body’s ready to build new protection. Think of it as reinforcing the shield before the next wave hits.  Translate 4/10 “So bila boleh ambil vaksin lepas sembuh, Doc?” 👉 Generally, 4 weeks after recovery is safe. By then, the body’s ready to build new protection. Think of it as reinforcing the shield before the next wave hits.",https://www.threads.com/@dr.nisa.khalil/post/DPsnT-kj9JA,"",0,0,0,0,NaN
